WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.230
I objected [to] raising money to build a black swimming pool.

2
00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.020
I lost out.

3
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:21.780
When we got a golf course, we had a suit pending; we had a federal judge that was not in favor of integrating.

4
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:26.380
They hurriedly built a black golf course, nine holes.

5
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.240
I objected to that.

6
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.900
I was invited to the dedication, but I did not go.
